!************* HEADING ********************************************
!
!  tutorial: oblique directional spread waves over 2D sloping beach
!
!*********** MODEL INPUT ******************************************

CGRID  0. 0. 0. 220. 200. 1000 50 REPEAT Y

INPGRID BOTTOM 0. 0. 0. 1 1 220. 200.
READINPUT BOTTOM 1. 'bathy.txt' 1 0 FREE

NONHYDROSTATIC
BREAK
$FRIC MANNING 0.02
FRIC LOG ROUGH 0.001
VISC SMAG

SET SEED 123456789
BOUND SHAPE JONSWAP SIG PEAK DSPR DEGRees
BOUND SIDE West CCW BTYPE WEAK ADDB CON SPECTrum h=0.85 per=15. dir=10. dd=20. cycle 20 min

DISCRET UPW  MOM
DISCRET UPW WMOM H NONE

!************* OUTPUT REQUESTS ************************************

QUANT DIST HEXP 10.
QUANT HS MVEL DUR 20 MIN

CURVE 'transect' 0. 100. 1000 1000. 100.
TABLE 'transect' NOHEAD 'output.txt' DIST BOTLEV HS SETUP MVEL

BLOCK 'COMPGRID' NOHEAD 'output.mat' LAY 3 XP YP BOTLEV MVEL

$-- 2D snapshots: WATL, VEL  every 5 s after 100 s spinup
BLOCK 'COMPGRID' NOHEAD 'wlev.mat' LAYOUT 3 WATL &
      OUTPUT 000100.000 5. SEC
BLOCK 'COMPGRID' NOHEAD 'vel.mat'  LAYOUT 3 VEL  &
      OUTPUT 000100.000 5. SEC

COMPUTE 000000.000 0.05 SEC 001500.000

STOP
